    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "On ex parte application made by a peace officer or public officer, the justice or judge who made the order — or a judge in the judicial district where the order was made — may, on the basis of an information on oath in Form 5.0081, revoke or vary the order"

