       AND `there are reasonable grounds to believe that the disclosure during that period would jeopardize the conduct of the investigation of the offence to which the demand or order relates`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must be satisfied by information on oath in Form 5.009"

